22. Current authoritative protocol references verified on 2026-08-26 are ISO
    5495:2005 with Amendment 1:2016 for paired comparison, ISO 6658:2017
    (confirmed in 2024) for general sensory methodology, ISO 11136:2014 with
    Amendment 1:2020 (base standard confirmed in 2025) for controlled consumer
    hedonic testing, ISO 11132:2021 for quantitative descriptive-panel
    performance, ISO 13299:2016 for sensory profiling, and ASTM E2263-25 for
    paired preference. ISO 11132:2021 and ISO 13299:2016 are under systematic
    review. The implementation review must recheck current status, bind the
    purchased or official edition and scope, and never reproduce copyrighted
    standard text.
